### Feature RecipeIngredient — CREATE
### Modalidad JWT + RBAC. Recurso `POST /api/recipe-ingredients`: solo lo concede ADMIN (SELLER no).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Login SELLER
# @name loginSeller
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "seller",
  "password": "Seller123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
@sellerToken = {{loginSeller.response.body.$.access_token}}

### CREATE — admin -> 201
# @name createRecipeIngredient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipe-ingredients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "ingredientId": 1,
  "quantity": 0.1,
  "status": "active"
}

### 403 — el SELLER NO tiene concedido `POST /api/recipe-ingredients` (deny by default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipe-ingredients
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "ingredientId": 1,
  "quantity": 0.1
}

### 401 — sin token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipe-ingredients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "ingredientId": 1,
  "quantity": 0.1
}
